flowchart TD
 A[Input sentence] --> B[Normalize case, punctuation, apostrophes and spaces]
 B --> C[Load cached CSV dictionary]
 C --> D{Exact normalized key?}
 D -->|Found| E[Return stored gloss]
 D -->|Not found| F[Return None; do not invent gloss]
 E --> G[Tokenize gloss]
 G --> H[Resolve aliases and sign assets]
 F --> I[English fingerspelling fallback]
 H -->|Asset missing| I
